					<![CDATA[
						 <p>content: &quot;<strong>项目描述：</strong>一件██公司出品的衬衫，会使穿戴者感觉很扎并认为是自己的头发粘在了里面。\n<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██\n<strong>回收地点：</strong>外勤特工luris的家中。\n<strong>当前状态：</strong>存放于Area-CN-15的低价值异常物品储藏室内。\n<strong>笔记：</strong><em>有被冒犯到<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-49357-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >1</a></sup>。&#8212;luris</em>&quot;</p> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kaster-k" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6606914&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609856035" alt="kaster-k" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6606914)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kaster-k" >kaster-k</a></span></p> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">脚注</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-49357-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. luris曾在一次行动中失去了全部的头发。</div> </div> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
