&lt;p&gt;CSS改编自安德森机器人的CSS版式。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;动态图标来自主站的超形上学部版式。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;人物设定图来自&lt;span class=&quot;printuser&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/breaddddd&quot;  &gt;breaddddd&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;、HHHHHoi君、Jormun。均已经过授权，非商用，有使用权。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;落雪动态来自&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/df-thirteen&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4011450&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609856035&quot; alt=&quot;DF-thirteen&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4011450)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/df-thirteen&quot;  &gt;DF-thirteen&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;的落雪艺作页。&lt;br /&gt;
TAB形式Taken from Anderson Robotics theme by Croquembouche! Modified by Aers for Alces_alces （copy自&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/62ecn&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4008607&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609856035&quot; alt=&quot;62ECN&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4008607)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/62ecn&quot;  &gt;62ECN&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;的作者页）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;而统计页面代码来自于&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/m-element&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2941964&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609856035&quot; alt=&quot;M Element&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2941964)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/m-element&quot;  &gt;M Element&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;，&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/apmv&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3550607&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609856035&quot; alt=&quot;#ApmV&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3550607)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/apmv&quot;  &gt;#ApmV&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;，其中&lt;span class=&quot;printuser&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/apmv&quot;  &gt;#ApmV&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;的代码来自于&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/w-asriel&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3317001&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609856035&quot; alt=&quot;W Asriel&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3317001)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/w-asriel&quot;  &gt;W Asriel&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;，而后者又是从主站找来的代码。&lt;br /&gt;
但是现在是从&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rye-travis&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3290685&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609856035&quot; alt=&quot;Rye Travis&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3290685)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rye-travis&quot;  &gt;Rye Travis&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;这里找来的代码（据说也是&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sekai-s&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4476849&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609856035&quot; alt=&quot;Sekai_s&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4476849)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sekai-s&quot;  &gt;Sekai_s&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;的作品）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;本作者页作者为&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/meltyland-nightmare&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6167306&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609856035&quot; alt=&quot;Meltyland Nightmare&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6167306)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/meltyland-nightmare&quot;  &gt;Meltyland Nightmare&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;，并且正在不断咕咕咕中。&lt;/p&gt;
